## Requirements

| Dependency | Version |
|---|---|
| .NET | 10.0 |
| Umbraco CMS | ≥ 15.0 |

> **Compatibility matrix**
>
> | Package | Umbraco |
> |---------|---------|
> | `1.x`   | 15.x · 16.x · 17.x |
> | `2.x`   | 18.x *(planned)* |
>
> Versions 13 and 14 are **not supported** — `IPublishedContentCache.GetByIdAsync` was introduced in Umbraco 15.

